    "Roadmap decision note\n\nRevision V2: rank versioning, advanced search, visual history and montage by user value. This capture was kept because it is reused across client messages, internal notes, product planning and browser-based research. It includes the exact wording, the source context and the operational nuance that normally disappears after a few minutes of tab switching.\n\nDecision: convert the capture into a more operational note with bullets, ownership, risk, and a suggested next step. Before using it again, verify the date, adapt the tone to the audience, keep the useful source URL attached and add a short note if the capture becomes part of a repeatable workflow.\n\nNext actions: attach a short personal note, mark it as reusable, and keep the source URL visible for later verification.": "路线图决策说明\n\n修订版 V2：按用户价值对版本控制、高级搜索、视觉历史记录和蒙太奇进行排名。之所以保留此捕获，是因为它可以在客户消息、内部注释、产品规划和基于浏览器的研究中重复使用。它包括准确的措辞、源上下文和操作上的细微差别，这些细微差别通常在选项卡切换几分钟后就会消失。\n\n决策：将捕获内容转换为更具操作性的说明，其中包含要点、所有权、风险和建议的下一步。再次使用之前，请验证日期、调整语气以适应观众、附加有用的源 URL，并在捕获成为可重复工作流程的一部分时添加简短注释。\n\n下一步操作：附加简短的个人注释，将其标记为可重复使用，并保持源 URL 可见以供以后验证。",
    "Roadmap decision note\n\nRevision V2: rank versioning, advanced search, visual history and montage by user value. This capture was kept because it is reused across client messages, internal notes, product planning and browser-based research. It includes the exac": "路线图决策说明\n\n修订版 V2：按用户价值对版本控制、高级搜索、视觉历史记录和蒙太奇进行排名。之所以保留此捕获，是因为它可以在客户消息、内部注释、产品规划和基于浏览器的研究中重复使用。它包括精确的",
    "Roadmap decision note V3": "路线图决策说明 V3",
    "Roadmap decision note\n\nRevision V3: rank versioning, advanced search, visual history and montage by user value. This version is longer because the user has refined the capture after using it in a real workflow. It keeps the original intent, adds clearer sequencing, removes vague wording and makes the reusable part obvious.\n\nDecision: save the strongest phrasing, preserve the supporting context, and make sure the capture can be found by title, note, URL and category.\n\nNext actions: use it as a source-backed block, then update the title if a more precise project name appears.": "路线图决策说明\n\n修订版 V3：按用户价值对版本控制、高级搜索、视觉历史记录和蒙太奇进行排名。该版本较长，因为用户在实际工作流程中使用后对捕获进行了改进。它保留了最初的意图，添加了更清晰的顺序，删除了模糊的措辞并使可重用的部分变得明显。\n\n决策：保存最有力的措辞，保留支持上下文，并确保可以通过标题、注释、URL 和类别找到捕获的内容。\n\n下一步操作：将其用作源支持的块，然后在出现更精确的项目名称时更新标题。",
